  "title": "Westamerica Bancorporation Increases Stock Repurchase Plan Authorization",
  "summary": "San Rafael, CA: The Board of Directors of Westamerica Bancorporation (NASDAQ: WABC) today announced that its Board of Directors approved an increase in the Company’s stock repurchase plan authorization by 2,000,000 shares. After accounting for shares previously purchased, and the 785,023 available under the prior authorization, the Company currently has 2,785,023 shares remaining under the […] The post Westamerica Bancorporation Increases Stock Repurchase Plan Authorization first appeared on Westamerica Bank .",
